@* The browser tab, the task switcher and an installed window all show <title>. A page that sets
   only its own name ("Tasks") is unidentifiable among a dozen tabs and, once installed, among a
   dozen apps - which is how the product's name disappeared from its own UI. One component so the
   brand cannot drift page by page. *@
<PageTitle>@Title - @Brand</PageTitle>

@code {
    /// <summary>The product name, appended to every page title.</summary>
    public const string Brand = "Echelon";

    /// <summary>The page's own title, already localized.</summary>
    [Parameter, EditorRequired] public string Title { get; set; } = Brand;
}
